28ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E24-MJMAIN-2227\" d=\"M318 591Q325 598 333 598Q344 598 348 591Q349 590 414 445T545 151T611 -4Q609 -22 591 -22Q588 -22 586 -21T581 -20T577 -17T575 -13T572 -9T570 -4L333 528L96 -4Q87 -20 80 -21Q78 -22 75 -22Q57 -22 55 -4Q55 2 120 150T251 444T318 591Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E24-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E24-MJMAIN-2227\" x=\"973\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E24-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"1863\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> are logically equivalent since they have identical truth values. </p>\n<p>We also have the following logical equivalence for the disjunction of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.745ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 751.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-25-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-25-Title\">P</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E25-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E25-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> with itself.\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.917ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 4700.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-26-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-26-Title\">\nP \\lor P \\equiv P\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMAIN-2228\" d=\"M55 580Q56 587 61 592T75 598Q86 598 96 580L333 48L570 580Q579 596 586 597Q588 598 591 598Q609 598 611 580Q611 574 546 426T415 132T348 -15Q343 -22 333 -22T318 -15Q317 -14 252 131T121 425T55 580Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E26-MJMAIN-2261\" d=\"M56 444Q56 457 70 464H707Q722 456 722 444Q722 430 706 424H72Q56 429 56 444ZM56 237T56 250T70 270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H70Q56 237 56 250ZM56 56Q56 71 72 76H706Q722 70 722 56Q722 44 707 36H70Q56 43 56 56Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E26-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E26-MJMAIN-2228\" x=\"973\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E26-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"1863\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E26-MJMAIN-2261\" x=\"2892\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E26-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"3949\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>We can justify this result using a truth table. </p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.52ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1084.8 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-27-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-27-Title\">\\,P\\,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E27-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51 1Q33 1 33 11Q33 13 36 25Q40 41 44 43T67 46Q94 46 127 49Q141 52 146 61Q149 65 218 339T287 628ZM645 554Q645 567 643 575T634 597T609 619T560 635Q553 636 480 637Q463 637 445 637T416 636T404 636Q391 635 386 627Q384 621 367 550T332 412T314 344Q314 342 395 342H407H430Q542 342 590 392Q617 419 631 471T645 554Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E27-MJMATHI-50\" x=\"166\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></td>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\"><span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3